00:17:46,996 --> 00:17:51,179
[SPEAKER_01]: Or, more accurately, there can be no mindfulness without intentional basis.

204
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:57,323
[SPEAKER_01]: So, even if you're restraining a physical action, there is an intentional basis to act.

205
00:17:58,524 --> 00:18:03,407
